<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49931" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵδρ-ῡσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>founding, foundation</i>, esp. of temples, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερῶν -σεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					427b
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.337
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				909e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ. ξοάνων</span>
			<i>setting up</i> of statues, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως ἵδρυσιν λαμβανούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμέω ἱδρύσιες</span>
			<i>statues</i> of Hermes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.253
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>settlement, abode</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.408a
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔχειν ἵ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				651d
			</span></i>, etc. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> only in
			later Poets, <u>AP</u> l.c.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
